            <title>[IGNITE-13365] GridCacheDatabaseSharedManager.releaseHistoryForExchange may throw AssertionError when WALMode.NONE is used.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13365</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
